    <string name="dialog_formats_title">Supported formats</string>
    <string name="dialog_formats_body">PDF — rendered with the built-in Android PDF renderer.\n\nDOCX — headings, bold/italic/underline, lists, tables, links and inline images.\n\nXLSX — multiple sheets, text, numbers and dates.\n\nPPTX — slides with text, bullets and pictures, including tables flattened to text.\n\nTXT — UTF-8/UTF-16 text with automatic encoding detection.\n\nMD — headings, emphasis, lists, quotes, code blocks and links.</string>
